															<h2>Baseball News</h2>
																</div>
		
		<div class="content">
							<div class="post">
  <div class="post-inner">
    <div class="img-wrap">
              <a href="https://www.bhc.edu/news/2026/10/adaptive-baseball-program/" target="_self"><img decoding="async" src="https://www.bhc.edu/wp-content/uploads/Adaptivebaseball_group-600x338.png" alt="Adaptive baseball program group with bhc players and participants" title="Baseball"></a>
          </div>
    <div class="content-inner">
                    <h3><a href="https://www.bhc.edu/news/2026/10/adaptive-baseball-program/" target="_self">BHC baseball and RI Parks host Adaptive Baseball Program</a></h3>
      
              <p class="post-excerpt">
          Since 2023, the Black Hawk College baseball team has partnered with Rock Island Parks and Recreation to host an adaptive baseball program for participants of all ages with disabilities.        </p>
          </div>
  </div>
</div>
							<div class="post">
  <div class="post-inner">
    <div class="img-wrap">
              <a href="https://www.bhc.edu/news/2026/07/94-student-athletes-win-all-conference-academic-award/" target="_self"><img decoding="async" src="https://www.bhc.edu/wp-content/uploads/Athletics_BravesFeatImg_2026-600x338.jpg" alt="Fierce hawk logo and athletics title" title="Baseball"></a>
          </div>
    <div class="content-inner">
                    <h3><a href="https://www.bhc.edu/news/2026/07/94-student-athletes-win-all-conference-academic-award/" target="_self">94 student-athletes win all-conference academic award</a></h3>
      
              <p class="post-excerpt">
          Congratulations to the 94 Black Hawk College student-athletes who earned the 2025-26 National Junior College Athletic Association (NJCAA) Arrowhead Academic All-Conference/Academic Excellence Award.        </p>
          </div>
  </div>
</div>
							<div class="post">
  <div class="post-inner">
    <div class="img-wrap">
              <a href="https://www.bhc.edu/news/2026/07/bhc-student-athletes-win-2025-26-national-academic-awards/" target="_self"><img decoding="async" src="https://www.bhc.edu/wp-content/uploads/Athletics_BravesFeatImg_2026-600x338.jpg" alt="Fierce hawk logo and athletics title" title="Baseball"></a>
          </div>
    <div class="content-inner">
                    <h3><a href="https://www.bhc.edu/news/2026/07/bhc-student-athletes-win-2025-26-national-academic-awards/" target="_self">BHC student-athletes win 2025-26 national academic awards</a></h3>
      
              <p class="post-excerpt">
          Fifty-three student-athletes representing all eight Black Hawk College sports teams recently earned All-Academic Team honors from the National Junior College Athletic Association (NJCAA) for their 2025-26 overall GPAs.        </p>
          </div>
  </div>
</div>
							<div class="post">
  <div class="post-inner">
    <div class="img-wrap">
              <a href="https://www.bhc.edu/news/2026/07/braves-baseball-golf-softball-earn-post-season-awards/" target="_self"><img decoding="async" src="https://www.bhc.edu/wp-content/uploads/Athletics_BravesFeatImg_2026-600x338.jpg" alt="Fierce hawk logo and athletics title" title="Baseball"></a>
          </div>
    <div class="content-inner">
                    <h3><a href="https://www.bhc.edu/news/2026/07/braves-baseball-golf-softball-earn-post-season-awards/" target="_self">Braves baseball, golf, softball earn post-season awards</a></h3>
      
              <p class="post-excerpt">
          Congratulations to the Braves baseball, golf and softball teams for earning multiple post-season awards!        </p>
          </div>
  </div>
</div>
								</div>

			</div>
</div>


